WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.280
SCP-999 Vs SCP-096. The Tickle Monster vs the “Oh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.560
god it’s killing everyone who saw&nbsp;
its face” monster. Who would win?

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.320
Given that 096’s last battle with a&nbsp;
possible child of the Scarlet King&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:17.200
resulted in a stalemate, we think there’s a&nbsp;
good chance of it happening this time, too.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.440
999’s powers of positivity may help&nbsp;
level out this anxious mass-killer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.960
and begin to slowly raise its&nbsp;
depressingly low self-esteem.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.600
Maybe it won’t feel so murderously upset&nbsp;
about people seeing its face anymore. Perhaps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:35.840
after a Rom-Com style makeover montage with&nbsp;
999, 096 will be able to hit the dating scene.&nbsp;

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.120
Look out, ladies...

